        "title": "Add YoLink Home",
        "description": "Enter your YoLink User Access Credentials (UAC) for the home you want to add.\n\nTo create UAC credentials:\n1. Open YoLink mobile app\n2. Go to [Account] → [Advanced Settings] → [Personal Access Credentials]\n3. Tap [+] to create new credentials\n4. Make sure you're viewing the correct home first\n\nEach set of credentials is tied to one home, allowing you to add multiple homes separately.\n\nDocs: {uac_docs}",
